{"SurveyID":"SV_bynxxD5ddXRJNhc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID952","SecondaryAttribute":"Bomb on the Train Intelligence services have detected two coordinated terrorist attacks using bom...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Bomb on the Train<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nIntelligence services have detected two coordinated terrorist attacks using bombs on cargo trains, one heading towards the warehouse station of Kaxraz and one heading towards the warehouse station of Izzook. The front cars carry bulk goods, which is where the bomb is located. The rear cars contain valuable goods. Once the trains reach their respective destinations to deliver the cargo, the bombs will explode, destroying all goods already in the warehouse stations, but the rear cars will stick out of the stations so the valuable good will be fine.<br>\nThe intelligence services have one drone available which can be sent to bomb one of the trains before it reaches its destination, at the cost of destroying all the valuable goods in the train. This leaves the intelligence agency two choices:\n<br><br>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option1<\/i>:\nSend a drone to bomb the train headed for Khaxraz. This will destroy 10 Gold Wriarints worth of goods on the train but save 30 Gold Wriarints worth of goods in the station.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option2<\/i>:\nSend a drone to bomb the train headed for Izzook. This will destroy 30 Gold Wriarints worth of goods on the train but save 60 Gold Wriarints worth of goods in the station.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<\/ul><br<br><br>\n\n\nIf you were faced with this choice, would you choose option 1 or option 2?\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.trainBomb.econ.comparisonType.ratio_vs_utility_1.5utility_3xvictims.n_saved1.30.n_saved2.60.n_total1.40.n_total2.90.n_victims1.10.n_victims2.30.high_ratio_first","QuestionID":"QID952","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","QuestionDescription":"Bomb on the Train Intelligence services have detected two coordina