{"SurveyID":"SV_bynxxD5ddXRJNhc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1310","SecondaryAttribute":"Forced Siege While watching the actions of Emperor Hyikra via drones, the intelligence agency see...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Forced Siege<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nWhile watching the actions of Emperor Hyikra via drones, the intelligence agency sees that he has released two herds of trained Kirorians into the western and eastern forests to lure out wild Kirorians. The emperor then kills the wild Kirorians for pleasure. As Kirorians are a protected species, the intelligence agency must intervene and protect them.<br>\nThe intelligence agency has one drone at their disposal to drop a bomb on one of the heards of trained Kirorians, killing them. The intelligence agency thus has two options:\n<br><br>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option1<\/i>:\nSend the drone to bomb the Kiriorians heading towards the eastern forest. This would kill the 90 trained Kirorians but save 500 Kirorians in the forest.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option2<\/i>:\nSend the drone to bomb the Kiriorians heading towards the western forest. This would kill the 30 trained Kirorians but save 300 Kirorians in the forest.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<\/ul><br<br><br>\n\n\nIf you were faced with this choice, would you choose option 1 or option 2?\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.forcedSiege.econ.comparisonType.ratio_vs_utility_1.5utility_3xvictims.n_saved1.300.n_saved2.500.n_total1.330.n_total2.585.n_victims1.30.n_victims2.90.high_ratio_second","QuestionID":"QID1310","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","QuestionDescription":"Forced Siege While watching the actions of Emperor Hyikra via drones, the intelligence agency see...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1: Definitely Option 1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6: Definitely Option 2"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Forc