{"SurveyID":"SV_bynxxD5ddXRJNhc","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1082","SecondaryAttribute":"Forced Siege While watching the army of Emperor Hyikra via drones conquer another country, the in...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Forced Siege<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nWhile watching the army of Emperor Hyikra via drones conquer another country, the intelligence agency sees that he has forced the men to serve as soldiers in his army by taking their families hostage. These slave soldiers have no choice but to follow Hyikra's orders to save their families. Hyikra divides the slave soldiers into two armies. He orders the first army to burn down the settlement of Onaphis, while sending the second army to burn down the settlement of Kipwik. <br>\nThe intelligence agency has one drone at their disposal to drop a bomb on one of the marching armies of slave soldiers. This leaves the intelligence agency with two options:\n<br><br>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option1<\/i>:\nSend the drone to bomb the slave soldiers heading to Kipwik. This would kil 6 slave soldiers but save 60 people in Kipwik.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<li>\n<i>Option2<\/i>:\nSend the drone to bomb the slave soldiers heading to Onaphis. This would kill 2 slave soldiers but save 40 people in Onaphis.\n\n<\/li>\n\n<\/ul><br<br><br>\n\n\nIf you were faced with this choice, would you choose option 1 or option 2?\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.forcedSiege.moral.comparisonType.ratio_vs_utility_1.5utility_3xvictims.n_saved1.40.n_saved2.60.n_total1.42.n_total2.69.n_victims1.2.n_victims2.6.high_ratio_second","QuestionID":"QID1082","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","QuestionDescription":"Forced Siege While watching the army of Emperor Hyikra via drones conquer another country, the in...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"1: Definitely Option 1"},"2":{"Display":"2"},"3":{"Display":"3"},"4":{"Display":"4"},"5":{"Display":"5"},"6":{"Display":"6: Definitely Option 2"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4",